  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/81fcb56d7fc54db831facf5febbdd1e021bb7fcc.gif\" alt=\"鋤頭動作\" width=\"100%\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540mypunchymod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\" alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmodinpunchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"60px\"></a></div><br><br><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><section><p>Punchy! 徹底改變了《Minecraft》中的戰鬥與移動體驗。流暢的動畫、手中物理效果，以及即時調整，為每個動作增添了重量感、風格與個性。它的設計讓一切感覺生動，同時不破壞資源包的相容性。</p></section></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><div><span><span><iframe style=\"width:850px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dvTgIbiwHqc?si=vizVyP9oyUwas2KA\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e0f59a12115269646e828a6f7c65f7139efce1.webp\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"30%\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47c36b807e44592bbfd39206911585e92010abc4.gif\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"100%\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>為達到<strong>最佳相容性</strong>與 Better Combat 擴充功能搭配，請使用此資源包：</p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modded-swords-x-punchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5b655780b2e2a45f484af6e93f268e0c677357c.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"80px\"></a><br><em>點擊檢視</em></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c571a5ef1176c92ce66a7157c33dd1779420632.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"300px\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>相較於個別的資源包，<br>所有<strong>明確的 Punchy! 相容性功能</strong>都整合在單一的 Modrinth 收藏集中。</p><p>此收藏集會持續更新，並包含官方推薦的相容性包。</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.punchymod.com%252f%2523compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1295a4a95570fdd19437f2af3d6edb9ef0cf9cd1_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy! 相容性收藏集\" width=\"320\"></a><p><em>點擊檢視完整的 Modrinth 收藏集</em></p></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2bb0d76282288d92aa6d210cac2db4384ac8f439.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"400px\"><section><h3>致謝</h3>Godku 提供的所有幫助。<br>Jaredlll08 提供的多載入器模板：<a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaredlll08 GitHub 頁面</a><br>Lunggolfs 提供的社交連結圖示包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunggolfs.itch.io%252fsocial-connect-icons-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lunggolfs 網站</a><br>CRV6 提供的預告片和精彩音樂：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CRV6-Music/featured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CRV6 YouTube 頻道</a><br>Craftandoof 提供的超讚起床動畫：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcraftandoof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craftandoof Modrinth 個人資料</a><br>themodderg 提供的簡潔經典模組圖示：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fthemodderg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">themodderg Modrinth 個人資料</a><br>choccy_milk55 提供的流暢模組介紹動畫：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fchoccy_milk55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">choccy_milk55 Modrinth 個人資料</a></section><br><section><h3>授權</h3>ARR（版權所有）<br>您無需徵求許可即可將此模組包含在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包中。<br>不允許重新分發 jar 檔案（請勿在任何其他地方分享 jar 檔案）。</section></div></div>",
